invariant: INV-36
file: pem_files.h
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: pem_files.h declares the chain and key calls in every build, so
  a client object, which compiles no pem_files.c server arm, declares
  them too, and a program that calls one compiles and then fails to link.
  zig-build-check.sh translates the header under each object's defines
  and refuses a declaration the object neither exports nor imports.

--- old
#ifdef CH_ROLE_SERVER
#ifdef CH_TRANSPORT_QUIC_NONBLOCKING
#define ch_chain_from_pem ch_chain_from_pem_quic_nonblocking
--- new
#if 1
#ifdef CH_TRANSPORT_QUIC_NONBLOCKING
#define ch_chain_from_pem ch_chain_from_pem_quic_nonblocking
